{
  "id": "GEN.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Genesis 18",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah appeared unto him by the oaks of Mamre, as he sat in the tent door in the heat of the day; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he lifted up his eyes and looked, and, lo, three men stood over against him: and when he saw them, he ran to meet them from the tent door, and bowed himself to the earth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and said, My lord, if now I have found favor in thy sight, pass not away, I pray thee, from thy servant: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "let now a little water be fetched, and wash your feet, and rest yourselves under the tree: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I will fetch a morsel of bread, and strengthen ye your heart; after that ye shall pass on: forasmuch as ye are come to your servant. And they said, So do, as thou hast said. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abraham hastened into the tent unto Sarah, and said, Make ready quickly three measures of fine meal, knead it, and make cakes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abraham ran unto the herd, and fetched a calf tender and good, and gave it unto the servant; and he hasted to dress it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he took butter, and milk, and the calf which he had dressed, and set it before them; and he stood by them under the tree, and they did eat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they said unto him, Where is Sarah thy wife? And he said, Behold, in the tent. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, I will certainly return unto thee when the season cometh round; and, lo, Sarah thy wife shall have a son. And Sarah heard in the tent door, which was behind him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Abraham and Sarah were old, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " well stricken in age; it had ceased to be with Sarah after the manner of women. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Sarah laughed within herself, saying, After I am waxed old shall I have pleasure, my lord being old also? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah said unto Abraham, Wherefore did Sarah laugh, saying, Shall I of a surety bear a child, who am old? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is anything too hard for Jehovah? At the set time I will return unto thee, when the season cometh round, and Sarah shall have a son. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Sarah denied, saying, I laughed not; for she was afraid. And he said, Nay; but thou didst laugh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the men rose up from thence, and looked toward Sodom: and Abraham went with them to bring them on the way. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah said, Shall I hide from Abraham that which I do; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "seeing that Abraham shall surely become a great and mighty nation, and all the nations of the earth shall be blessed in him? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I have known him, to the end that he may command his children and his household after him, that they may keep the way of Jehovah, to do righteousness and justice; to the end that Jehovah may bring upon Abraham that which he hath spoken of him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah said, Because the cry of Sodom and Gomorrah is great, and because their sin is very grievous; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will go down now, and see whether they have done altogether according to the cry of it, which is come unto me; and if not, I will know.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the men turned from thence, and went toward Sodom: but Abraham stood yet before Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abraham drew near, and said, Wilt thou consume the righteous with the wicked? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peradventure there are fifty righteous within the city: wilt thou consume and not spare the place for the fifty righteous that are therein? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That be far from thee to do after this manner, to slay the righteous with the wicked, that so the righteous should be as the wicked; that be far from thee: shall not the Judge of all the earth do right? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah said, If I find in Sodom fifty righteous within the city, then I will spare all the place for their sake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abraham answered and said, Behold now, I have taken upon me to speak unto the Lord, who am but dust and ashes: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "peradventure there shall lack five of the fifty righteous: wilt thou destroy all the city for lack of five? And he said, I will not destroy it, if I find there forty and five. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he spake unto him yet again, and said, Peradventure there shall be forty found there. And he said, I will not do it for the forty’s sake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, Oh let not the Lord be angry, and I will speak: peradventure there shall thirty be found there. And he said, I will not do it, if I find thirty there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, Behold now, I have taken upon me to speak unto the Lord: peradventure there shall be twenty found there. And he said, I will not destroy it for the twenty’s sake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, Oh let not the Lord be angry, and I will speak yet but this once: peradventure ten shall be found there. And he said, I will not destroy it for the ten’s sake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah went his way, as soon as he had left off communing with Abraham: and Abraham returned unto his place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
